      "read_view": "Algorithm 1 Simulation of the ideal conditional half-turn process\n\n\n\n\n 1:\n \n \n Input: state [MATH alg1.l1.m1: (x,y)] \n\n\n\n\n 2:\n \n \n Draw [MATH alg1.l2.m1: \\widetilde{X}\\sim\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}] and\n [MATH alg1.l2.m2: p_{0}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I)] independently.\n\n\n\n\n 3:\n \n \n Query [MATH alg1.l3.m1: \\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})] .\n\n\n\n\n 4:\n \n \n Set [MATH alg1.l4.m1: x_{0}\\leftarrow x] .\n\n\n\n\n 5:\n \n \n Evolve [MATH alg1.l5.m1: (x_{t},p_{t})] according to\n\n\n\n\n\n\n [MATH S3.E8.m1: \\dot{x}=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,p\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\dot{p}=-\\frac{x-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}-\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})\\,,] \n\n(3.8)\nuntil [MATH alg1.l5.m2: t=\\pi] .\n\n\n\n\n 6:\n \n \n During the evolution, generate bounce events at rate\n\n\n\n\n\n\n [MATH S3.E9.m1: \\lambda_{\\widetilde{X}}(x,p)=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\bigl[p^{\\top}[\\nabla V(x)-\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})]\\bigr]_{+}\\,.] \n\n(3.9)\n\n\n\n\n 7:\n \n \n At each bounce, set\n [MATH alg1.l7.m1: p_{t}\\leftarrow R_{\\nabla V(x_{t})-\\nabla V(\\widetilde{X})}p_{t}] .\n\n\n\n\n 8:\n \n \n return [MATH alg1.l8.m1: x_{\\pi}]"
    },
