      "read_view": "Let [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m1: (E_{n})_{n\\geq 1}] be independent [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m2: \\operatorname{Exp}(1)] \nrandom variables. Starting from\n [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m3: \\zeta_{0}\\coloneqq(x_{0},p_{0})] at time [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m4: T_{0}\\coloneqq 0] , define recursively\n\n\n\n\n\n [MATH A1.E1.m1: \\displaystyle S_{n+1}] \n [MATH A1.E1.m2: \\displaystyle\\coloneqq\\inf\\Bigl\\{u\\geq 0:\\int_{0}^{u}\\lambda_{\\widetilde{x}}(\\Phi_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}}))\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\geq E_{n+1}\\Bigr\\}\\,,] \n\n(A.1)\n\n\n\n [MATH A1.E2.m1: \\displaystyle T_{n+1}] \n [MATH A1.E2.m2: \\displaystyle\\coloneqq T_{n}+S_{n+1}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\zeta_{T_{n+1}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{S}_{\\widetilde{x}}\\bigl(\\Phi_{S_{n+1}}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}})\\bigr)\\,,] \n\n(A.2)\n\n\nwhen [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m5: S_{n+1}<\\infty] . If the set is empty, set\n [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m6: T_{n+1}=S_{n+1}=\\infty] and stop the recursion. Between jumps, set\n [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m7: \\zeta_{T_{n}+t}=\\Phi_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{x}}(\\zeta_{T_{n}})] for\n [MATH A1.SS1.p2.m8: 0\\leq t<S_{n+1}] ."
    },
